guide.kg.body.kg_a1:guide_recipe_gluten.4=Use an empty hand to flip. There is about a 1-second flip cooldown; flip 4 times total. After the fourth flip, use Special Seasoning. Oil points and seasoning uses are consumed per skewer on the grill. After seasoning, use an empty hand to extract; sneak with an empty hand to extract repeatedly. Grill stages cannot be skipped.
guide.kg.body.kg_a1:guide_recipe_gluten.5=Cooked effect: Haste · base 30 seconds.
guide.kg.body.kg_a1:guide_recipe_gluten.6=When eaten hot, newly gained fixed skewer effects have double duration and newly gained saturation is increased by 25%. Special Seasoning effects only trigger while the food is still hot; Hot Food does not double those seasoning durations a second time. Cold food remains edible, but those seasoning effects do not activate.
guide.kg.body.kg_a1:guide_recipe_gluten.7=Uncooked unfinished, fixed-raw, and Secret skewers can be sneak-disassembled to recover their ingredients and stick.
