guide.kg.name.kaleidoscope_cookery:oil_pot_filled=Cookery Oil Pot: Grilling Oils
guide.kg.body.kaleidoscope_cookery:oil_pot_filled.1=Acquisition: this is the host Oil Pot, not a new Grilling item. See the host guide for its base recipe; this page covers Grilling oil integration only.
guide.kg.body.kaleidoscope_cookery:oil_pot_filled.2=Grilling-oil capacity: 64 points. Use a main-hand oil bucket with an offhand pot, or draw oil from a source/vat; each bucket supplies 8 points.
guide.kg.body.kaleidoscope_cookery:oil_pot_filled.3=Brushing: use the filled pot on the grill. The action costs one oil point per loaded skewer. Different oils cannot be mixed in the same pot.
